# Phase 2 — Metric Driver-Tree Studio (Cursor)

Work from **repo root**. Governance session rules apply first (`make session-start`).

## SSOT (read before UI work)

| Layer | Authority |
|---|---|
| Product / phases | `PROJECT_CHARTER.md` + `governance/adrs/` (0003–0008) |
| Visual / layout / verbatim copy | `CLAUDE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` |
| Phase 1 engine/types | `driver_tree_studio/src/` (import only) |
| Copy-paste prompts | `tool_workflow_and_prompts_v4.md` (transient; not authority) |

Do **not** put UI rules in `CLAUDE.md` (agent protocol only).

## Prerequisites

- Review Gate 1: **approved**.
- Figma design ref: **pending** (charter §4). Shell/scaffolding OK with design-system tokens.
- Do not ship polished visual components until Figma ref exists. Scope: ADR-0008 Phase 2.

## Tool ownership (hard boundary)

**Cursor owns** (under `driver_tree_studio/`):

- `app/`, `public/`, `tailwind.config.ts`
- `src/components/` (one subdirectory per component)
- `src/hooks/`
- UI-only `src/lib/` (e.g. `modelLoader.ts`)

**Claude Code only** — never edit from Cursor:

- `src/engine/**`
- `src/lib/formula.ts`, `src/lib/rng.ts`
- `src/schema/**` (including `types.ts`, `validate.ts`)
- `src/content/**`, `tests/**`

Always **import** from engine/schema. Never duplicate `compute`, `validate`, `parseFormula`, or graph logic.

## Stack (ADR-0008)

Next.js 14 (App Router), TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, shadcn/ui, React Flow, Recharts, Framer Motion.

## Component and style conventions

- Tailwind utility classes only; no inline `style` except React Flow node/edge renderers where dynamic values are unavoidable.
- **No raw hex** in components — CSS custom properties in `app/globals.css` per `CLAUDE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` §2.
- Component file map: design doc §13.
- Every component file: JSDoc block at top (purpose, props, usage example).

## Load-bearing product invariants

**Three edge encodings** (never deviate; detail in design doc §5 + ADR-0004):

- `identity` — thick (4px) + blue
- `modeled` — normal (2px) + amber
- `hypothesized` — dashed (2px) + grey + "?" badge

**Edge-direction (critical):**

- Data model: `{ parent: explainedMetric, child: driverMetric }`
- React Flow renders **child → parent** (cause flows toward the north star)
- These directions are opposite. Parent is always the aggregate / north-star side.

**Verbatim copy:** methodology note, assumptions disclaimer, VoI caveat — exact text in `CLAUDE_DESIGN_SYSTEM.md` §7. Never shorten or paraphrase.

**Honesty language:** observational / data-test results never use "causes" or "causal relationship". Use "associated with", "moves together", "consistent with" (design doc §14, ADR-0008).

## Verification before closing a UI session

```bash
cd driver_tree_studio && npm run typecheck && npm test
```

If governance files were touched: `make verify` from repo root.
